1
00:00:00,480 --> 00:00:01,510
(Penny:)Okay, you know what?

2
00:00:01,514 --> 00:00:03,114
(Penny:)This is ridiculous.

3
00:00:03,116 --> 00:00:04,246
(Penny:)I've been trying to make

4
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,380
(Penny:)a connection with you all day,

5
00:00:05,385 --> 00:00:06,655
(Penny:)and clearly I'm getting nowhere.

6
00:00:06,653 --> 00:00:08,753
(Beverly:)Well, are you
seeking a connection

7
00:00:08,755 --> 00:00:11,385
(Beverly:)or just some form of validation?

8
00:00:11,391 --> 00:00:14,021
(Penny:)What I was seeking was
some sort of friendship.

9
00:00:14,027 --> 00:00:16,597
(Penny:)But at this point, I'll take you
not insulting me to my face.

10
00:00:16,596 --> 00:00:18,926
(Beverly:)My intention was never
to insult you.

11
00:00:18,932 --> 00:00:20,302
You've been doing it all day!

12
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,000
(Penny:)Do you even know
what an insult is?!

13
00:00:22,001 --> 00:00:23,971
(Beverly:)Well, it's not a clinical term.

14
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:26,670
(Beverly:)But one example would be
your marrying my son,

15
00:00:26,673 --> 00:00:28,373
(Beverly:)and not inviting me
or even telling me

16
00:00:28,375 --> 00:00:30,175
(Beverly:)the wedding was taking place.

17
00:00:32,912 --> 00:00:35,182
(Penny:)Okay, good example.

18
00:00:38,651 --> 00:00:41,791
(Sheldon:)What about Joss Whedon's work
makes you think he'd be okay

19
00:00:41,788 --> 00:00:43,818
(Sheldon:)with rule-breakers
and line-cutters?!

20
00:00:43,823 --> 00:00:45,623
The Avengers are rule-breakers!

21
00:00:45,625 --> 00:00:48,695
(Man:)Being vengeful is in
their job description!

22
00:00:48,695 --> 00:00:51,465
(Sheldon:)They work for SHIELD,

23
00:00:51,464 --> 00:00:53,694
(Sheldon:)which is a sanctioned department
of the U.S. Government!

24
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,370
(Sheldon:)Do you work for a
sanctioned department

25
00:00:55,368 --> 00:00:57,098
(Sheldon:)of the U.S. Government?

